    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "StockData.org provides free real-time, intraday, and historical stock, forex, and cryptocurrency market data along with global financial news and sentiment analysis. The API delivers market data for US-listed stocks including OHLCV data, splits, dividends, and entity-level news sentiment from 5,000+ sources in 30+ languages. All endpoints require an api_token parameter.",
